MarketAI Connector licence, version 1.1 (25 September 2026)

Copyright (c) 2026 MarketAI (https://app.marketai.trade).
"We" means MarketAI. "You" means the person or company that uses the connector.

1. Two kinds of files
The files in this repository, sergimes/marketai-connector, except this LICENSE, are
free to reuse (section 2). The connector itself is not (sections 3 to 6).

2. This repository's files
Anyone may use, copy, change and share every file in this repository except this
LICENSE, for any purpose, without asking us. They come without warranty, as in
section 8. If you share a changed version, do not present it as ours.

3. What "the connector" means
The connector is the MarketAI Connector software in every form: the container image
ghcr.io/sergimes/marketai-connector, any copy of it, every version and update, and
the source code inside it.

4. What you may do, free of charge
While you have a MarketAI account with at least one bot, you may:
- download the connector and keep copies of it for your own use;
- run it on your own computer, or on a server you rent;
- use it to follow the bots of your own MarketAI account, through MarketAI's service
  at app.marketai.trade;
- use it to trade exchange accounts that you own, or that your company owns and you
  are allowed to trade.
Someone else may set it up for you, as long as it trades only your accounts, for you.

5. What you may not do without our written permission
- Sell or rent the connector, or charge anyone for running it.
- Run it for someone else, or to trade money that belongs to other people (for
  example clients' accounts, or a vault that other people have deposited in).
- Share or publish copies of the connector, changed or not. Point people to our
  registry instead.
- Use it with any signal source other than MarketAI's service.
- Change it, or copy its source code, or any part of it, into other software.
You can read the source code inside the image. That does not make it open source, and
it gives you no right to reuse it.

6. Rights the law gives you anyway
This licence does not take away rights that the law gives every lawful user and that
no contract can remove. In the European Union these include making a backup copy and
studying how the software works.

7. Updates, and when this licence ends
- The connector updates itself unless you turn that off. Every update is covered by
  this licence.
- This licence ends by itself when you no longer have a MarketAI account with a bot,
  or if you break it and do not put that right within 14 days of our notice.
- We may end it for everyone, or stop offering the connector, with 30 days' notice.
- When it ends, stop running the connector and delete your copies. Stopping the
  connector does not close your positions: see DISCLAIMER.md.

8. No promise that it works as intended
We provide the connector free of charge and as it is. We do not promise that it has
no errors, that it runs without interruption, or that any order is placed, filled or
closed as intended. This does not limit any rights you have as a consumer.

9. Liability
Trading leveraged futures is risky, and you choose to do it. We are not liable for
losses that come from:
- how market prices move;
- the results of any signal feed you chose to follow;
- your exchange, your computer, your internet connection, or anything else we do not
  control;
- your settings, or how you look after your API keys.
For any other loss, our liability is limited as far as the law allows.
Nothing in this licence limits our liability:
- for harm we cause on purpose or through gross negligence;
- for death or personal injury;
- where the law does not allow it to be limited, including product liability law and
  consumer law.

10. Other people's software
The image contains open-source software by other authors: Python, Debian packages and
Python libraries. Each comes under its own licence, not this one, and its licence text
is in the image beside it. The updater in compose.yml (watchtower) is a separate
program under its own licence.

11. The MarketAI name
"MarketAI" is our name. This licence does not let you use it, except to say truthfully
that you use the connector.

12. Changes to this licence
We may publish a new version of this licence. It applies to connector versions released
after that. If you are a consumer, we tell you in advance, and you may stop using the
connector.

13. Law and courts
Spanish law applies. If you are a consumer, you also keep the protection of the
mandatory laws of the country where you live, and you may go to the courts there. For
everyone else, the courts of Barcelona, Spain, decide any dispute.

14. The rest
If MarketAI's terms of service say something different about the connector, those
terms apply. If a court finds one part of this licence invalid, the rest still applies.
